
### Get all actors
GET http://localhost:8080/actor

###

### Create Abebe
POST http://localhost:8080/actor
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Abebe",
  "movieName": "The Unknown"
}

###

### Create Martha
POST http://localhost:8080/actor
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Martha",
  "movieName": "Freedom"
}


### Get actor with ID 1
GET http://localhost:8080/actor/1

### Update actor with ID 1
PUT http://localhost:8080/actor/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Abebe Kebede",
  "movieName": "New Movie"
}


### Delete actor with ID 2
DELETE http://localhost:8080/actor/2